# prompt: soft cartoon hop
# tags: jump, hop, cartoon, soft
# The same rising gesture as `jump-8bit` with every hard edge removed: a sine
# instead of a square, a 6 ms attack instead of none, and a breath of low-passed
# noise for the feet leaving the ground.
sound "soft hop" 220ms
  hop: chirp sine ~260Hz[140..520] -> ~780Hz[400..1600] in 100ms | gain 0.42 attack 6ms decay 180ms
  air: noise pink >> lp ~1800Hz[700..4000] | gain 0.12 attack 10ms decay 90ms
